 realt\u00e0 virtuale, un'avvincente narrativa che tratta il tema del caporalato. Avrai a disposizione un mazzo di carte per sconfiggere la mafia, ogni carta porter\u00e0 conseguenza positive o negative in tutta la citt\u00e0. Fai la tua scelta e gioca la tua carta!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Logo_1440_Transparent.png", "id": "7043425425741004", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_7043425432407670_5671989590901130667_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9QHo2XmJTwQ7kNvwGBDWLt&_nc_oc=AdoTCLGz0GyOquuC7lWOeLM8arg5wefhytjMmL2w0C0ZusvS8nKwFErOaAXjNdOo1PE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUiTVWTvwOYT-1X9fzOEtWC3vL8GEKtPvJZaRvkwSIYOw&oe=6B105490"}, {"file_name": "CartaNostra_Logo02.png", "id": "2827330754076823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_2827330757410156_6515219377821251284_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wax-8tHMVZ8Q7kNvwH-dYch&_nc_oc=AdpNWWTTjrj17g25Aq3rnqZBLLbF9WSCtMkhQsX-LmLmWh76qxfsKa1gBna1F9JU-_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVBaBGzi1xSYY2V3Lp6wFf990GX_1YuF39RO8EUub0aXg&oe=6B106384"}, {"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Square_1440-1440.png", "id": "1149684542675806", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974692_1149684546009139_7602248288164393664_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6nyjb_nRbnMQ7kNvwHrqBeH&_nc_oc=AdpQLeWnmW-JrP8wDBYXX_Qr77AVphKBGi2ldcMmI-NUtaLU8_jbLJpHDUXtetmIsuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUG4qJJzzt5UuSr2hZVYc-FuvvwFICBEBkv_q-D37d5cA&oe=6B1045F0"}, {"file_name": "PDPART02.png", "id": "1140322596965596", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/390315